["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/republishedBy", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Designates a `from` Vulnerability's details were tracked, aggregated, and/or enriched to improve context (i.e. NVD) by each `to` Agent.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
